🔗 SMART LINKING FEATURE:

This version introduces intelligent sheet linking where:
1. A master sheet contains summary values (sums, totals, etc.)
2. Each value in the master sheet is linked to a specific sheet
3. System automatically determines which sheets to capture based on threshold conditions
4. Only sheets meeting the condition are included in the email

============================================
CONFIGURATION EXAMPLE:
============================================

'smart_linking': {
    'enabled': True,
    'master_sheet': 'Summary',      # Sheet with sum values
    'master_range': 'A1:H30',       # Range to capture from master
    'threshold_type': 'exceeds',    # Condition type
    'threshold_value': 1000,        # Threshold value
    
